# Runtime state: a zone rewrites this as people play, so tracking it means
# every playtest dirties the tree. The calibrated ladder.json is tracked; the
# live ratings are not.
#
# Unanchored, so it catches the copy a server writes wherever it is started
# from. The rule used to name zone/ only, and the root one got committed by
# somebody running the server from the repo root -- after which every test run
# rewrote a tracked file, and one of mine dropped a bot from the ladder
# entirely before I noticed.
ratings.json
